[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ、咲耶。まだいたのか\r\nもうだいぶ遅い時間だが、大丈夫なのか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "029"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、ファンレターの返事を書いておきたくてね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしたって、今日はTVの収録もあったのに……\r\nちゃんと休んでいないんじゃないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。私なら大丈夫だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンの子たちをいち早く喜ばせてあげたいからね\r\n休んでなんかいられないよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……それにしても、こんな時間までかかるなんて……\r\nいったい、何人分だ？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まだ１人分かな",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？　この長文が！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。そうだけど、どうしたんだい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……咲耶、熱心なファンはとても大切な存在だ\r\nそれは俺もよく分かる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だが、くれぐれも無理のない範囲にしてくれよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近、仕事も増えてきて\r\nただでさえ休む時間が減ってるだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。心配してくれているのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "大丈夫だよ、まだまだ体力はある\r\nそれに、これは私の好きでやっていることだからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら、いいんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ところで、プロデューサーの意見を\r\n聞かせてもらいたいんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンの子たちは、\r\nどうしたらもっと喜んでくれるだろう",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう充分喜ばせられていると思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンの子たちが喜んでくれる方法なら\r\nどんなことでも知りたいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やれやれ……\r\n咲耶は本当に熱心だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、あえて言うなら……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "ダンスや歌のレベルを\r\n上げることだな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "ありのままの咲耶で\r\nいることが大事だ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "咲耶自身が\r\n楽しむことが大事だ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶のダンスはキレがあってスピード感もある\r\nだが、止めの時に少しブレてしまっているだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ダンスは土台作りも大切だ\r\nこれからは体幹を鍛えることを意識してみてはどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー\r\nもっと美しいパフォーマンスができるよう頑張るよ！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "自分のためにも、ファンのためにも、\r\nもっと技術を磨かないとね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "よし！　このファンレターの返事を書きあげたら\r\n早速レッスンだ！",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……。この調子でファンレターを書いていたら\r\nレッスンをするのは深夜になってしまうぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも、上達するのが早ければ早いほど\r\nファンに喜んでもらえるだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はぁ……。熱心なのはいいことだが、もうこんな時間だ\r\n今日は帰って休んだ方がいい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "体調管理もアイドルの仕事のうちだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そうだね。今日はレッスンのスケジュールを\r\n立てるだけにしておくよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "よし！　レッスンは明日にしよう\r\n見ていてくれ、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも、それじゃファンは喜んでくれないだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンのみんなは、常に今の咲耶を見て\r\n好きになってくれているんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無理をしている咲耶を、見たいわけじゃない\r\nかえって不安にさせるぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……確かに、プロデューサーの言う通りだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど……もっと努力すべきだと思うし\r\n努力したくもあるんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今のままじゃ、私自身が納得できない……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "とはいえ、最近レッスンの量も増やして\r\nますます頑張っているだろう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶がこの調子でやっていけば、\r\nきっとファンも安心して喜んでくれるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本当に、今のままの私でも大丈夫なのかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありのままの咲耶が１番だ\r\nだから、くれぐれも無理はしないでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありのままの自分で、無理のないように、か……\r\nそれは少し、難しいかもしれないな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030230"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶は、人の繋がりを大事にしているよな\r\nだから、ファンサービスもこんなに頑張っているだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、人と人との繋がりは美しいからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そのためにも、ファンのみんなを笑顔にして\r\n幸せにしてあげたいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "良い考えだと思うぞ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その上で、咲耶自身が楽しんでいれば……\r\n仕事やパフォーマンスに、もっと磨きがかかるんじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、私はちゃんと楽しんでいるよ\r\nみんなに喜んでもらうことが、私の生きがいだからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ところで、プロデューサーはどうなんだい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何がだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私をプロデュースするのは、楽しいかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、楽しいというよりは、幸せかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "幸せ……\r\n私は、プロデューサーも幸せにできているのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "精一杯頑張って、どんどん輝いていく咲耶を\r\n間近で応援できるんだ。こんな幸せ者、そうそういないぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。そんな風に言ってもらえるなんて\r\n私のほうこそ幸せ者だな……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001030310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それじゃあ、プロデューサーをもっと喜ばせるためにも\r\n私自身も楽しんで頑張らなくてはね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600103/1006001030310"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]